WEBVTT

00:01:30.116 --> 00:01:31.476
I still remember.

00:01:32.356 --> 00:01:37.116
My family were one
of the thousands of families that fled.

00:01:37.116 --> 00:01:38.476
Not everyone was lucky,

00:01:38.516 --> 00:01:41.476
some lost their lives
while trying to escape.

00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:43.756
Because the journey was so dangerous,

00:01:43.756 --> 00:01:46.276
we had to hide frequently along the road.

00:01:46.276 --> 00:01:49.356
Where we used to live
is only two hours away,

00:01:49.396 --> 00:01:54.156
but the journey took two days
until we finally reached a safe place,

00:01:54.196 --> 00:01:57.476
the place that today we call
Otash IDP camp.

00:01:58.196 --> 00:02:01.076
During the two days
it took my family to the camp,